  "bodyHash": "6b642e23159c25dd",
  "content": "\n\n<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N7KuPsI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"763\" height=\"149\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JnRtoDNfJhs\" width=\"708\" height=\"417\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsaltywateroriginal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mRKyDfR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></a></p>\n<p>摸摸 Floppa 讓我買杯咖啡吧！&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>注意：</strong></span> 如果這個模組無法正常運作，請嘗試更換 Player Animator 的版本。</p>\n<h2>只用一個按鍵，你能表達多少？&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h2>\n<p>Sitting+ 是一款情境式坐著模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>安裝此模組後，只需按下 X 鍵即可在任何地方坐下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EX44BKW.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以切換姿勢，以更好地契合環境氛圍或用於角色扮演：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PAEz7ok.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以坐在柵欄上：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZouwpUV.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>（支援切換姿勢）</p>\n<p>您可以放鬆休息：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P63ZXbD.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>（支援切換姿勢）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;或是坐在階梯/半磚上：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DlGc4d9.gif\"></p>\n<p>（支援切換姿勢）</p>\n<h6><strong>（觸發姿勢時必須完全靜止不動）</strong></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>手持物品坐下時，會觸發該物品的專屬姿勢。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZZG7S4Z.gif\"></p>\n<p>...</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMXzqfS.gif\"></p>\n<p>...</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10kwN2n.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;（不過，您基本上可以將任何背包中的物品與專屬姿勢搭配使用。只要在觸發物品姿勢後切換到其他物品即可。）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>以下是由 Syx Games 製作的精彩短片，展示了 Sitting+ 如何提升各種 Minecraft 影片的效果：<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3KVd-W2Vvz8\" width=\"703\" height=\"414\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>以下是頻道 Enderverse 的精華影片，展示本模組、該頻道模組及其他模組的最佳搭配方式：</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6KpGUbnCGNs?lc=UgysLncMt7Y_GAAdqVB4AaABAg\" width=\"742\" height=\"416\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>如同影片所示，我強烈建議搭配第一人稱模組（如 Real Camera Mod）或第三人稱模組（如 Better Third Person Mod）一起使用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">有沒有很酷的姿勢創意？歡迎在留言區告訴我，或直接發送訊息給我！！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組需要 Player Animator <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>所有專案現已上架於：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsaltywater\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p1YdKLT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p>如果您想將此模組加入整合包，或在影片中展示本模組，非常歡迎。請發送私訊附上連結，讓我也能體驗整合包或觀看影片。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>別忘了看看我的其他模組，您的任何反饋都將不勝感激。</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salty-s-realistic-forging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YM3h2s3.png\" alt=\"Realistic Forging\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pickuptorches\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FyTh6pm.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplywalk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UckeY7D.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpanimation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m1WGasZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashbinned\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CiRnH8e.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/find-the-treasure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y37f1GQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplysneak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I8WXCEp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftingtakestime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962260/description_c05e2ade-ee28-45b2-93e5-93859f4a2265.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#169179\">我也製作 Vintage Story 模組！歡迎在此查看：<a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.vintagestory.at%252flist%252fmod%253fsortby%253dlastreleased%2526sortdir%253ddesc%2526text%253d%2526side%253d%2526userid%253d20368%2526mv%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltyWater</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>Peace.</p>",
